# ============================================================
# WorkBuddy 技能库汇总仓库 · 忽略规则
# ============================================================

# --- Python 编译缓存与虚拟环境 ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- 系统与编辑器 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
._*
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- 非自建技能：市场/技能中心安装，上游可随时重装，不纳入备份 ---
/ima-skills__skillhub/
/totorosir-workbuddy-checkin/
# 今后新安装的第三方技能按同样方式在此追加，保持仓库只含自建内容

# --- WorkBuddy 运行时迁移标记（由应用自动生成，非技能内容）---
/*_migration.json
/.disable_to_model_invocation_migration.json
/.model_invocation_to_override_migration.json
/.user_invocable_only_to_off_migration.json
/_bm_skillid_migration.json

# --- 凭证与本地配置（严禁入库）---
*.env
.env*
*-cred.json
*-rt.json
checkin-cred.json
checkin-rt.json
notify_config.json
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# --- 排版与渲染产物 ---
/output/
/~$*
*.log
*.tmp
